+---
+id: post-qftx-n1-wess-zumino-model
+kind: postulate
+title: Rigid four-dimensional N=1 Wess–Zumino sigma-model action
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
