+---
+id: pthm-qftx-n1-f-term-potential
+kind: physics-theorem
+title: Kähler-metric F-term scalar potential in the rigid N=1 model
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
